THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This project contains C++ ports of, and vendored code from, other projects.
Each is the work of its author and is credited here and in the wiki.

  CityHash (Google) — MIT. Vendored verbatim in src/fox/FoxCity.* for
  bit-exact hashing.

  GzsTool (Atvaark) — the QAR/SQAR, FPK/FPKD and PFTXS readers in src/fox/
  are direct ports of its format handling and ciphers.

  FtexTool (Atvaark) — the FTEX/FTEXS reader is a port of its layout
  handling; the writer is that reader's inverse.

  SnakeBite (topher-au and contributors) — the .mgsv metadata schema
  implemented in src/util/ModPackage.* is read from its source.

No game assets are included. Metal Gear Solid, Ground Zeroes, The Phantom
Pain, Metal Gear Online, Metal Gear Survive and Fox Engine are trademarks of
Konami; this project is not affiliated with Konami.

The hash dictionaries distributed alongside releases are community data,
principally from mgsv-lookup-strings (kapuragu) and the FoxBrowser
dictionaries, and remain the work of their contributors.
